<title>UK: EIB adds 250 billion lire to February 2007 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 250 billion lire to February 2007 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.0 trillion lire from 750 billion lire, joint lead managers BNP, IMI Luxembourg and San Paolo said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 TRN ITL   COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    12.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.325    PAY DATE    24.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	PLUS 72 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINAL DEAL LAUNCHED 13.JAN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
